{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bush_hazel","model_identifier":"bush_hazel","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bush_hazel\n\nHazel bush: a clump of straight thin stems about 2.5 m (89 u) tall from one root, round toothed leaves.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -22..20, y 0..89, z -18..21 units (1.18 x 2.50 x 1.10 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 92.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 20 x 89 x 20 stems clump (units can walk through)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): ready to harvest: tall straight sticks\n- `cut`: short cut stumps after the sticks are taken\n- `regrown`: the sticks growing back (about half height, fresh leaves)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"root","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.0,0.0,-11.0],"to":[11.0,4.0,11.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,184.0,22.0,188.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,184.0,22.0,188.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,184.0,22.0,188.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,184.0,22.0,188.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[76.0,0.0,98.0,22.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[76.0,0.0,98.0,22.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1929a983-ee97-53c8-b396-39a4421c5ab7"},{"name":"root_c","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.0,0.0,-11.0],"to":[11.0,4.0,11.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,